  "rationales": {"U":"'all executive branch agencies' lacks scope definition—e.g., does it include independent regulatory agencies like the FCC? 'reduce the current cost' is vague without baseline year or metric; evidence: 'all executive branch agencies' and 'reduce the current cost of operation and support'.","A":"'meet the needs' is subjective and context-dependent; no criteria define what constitutes 'meeting needs'; evidence: 'meet the needs of all executive branch agencies'.","C":"No factual inconsistency is evident—the intent to serve agencies and reduce cost is plausible; however, 'current cost' is underspecified but not factually wrong; evidence: 'reduce the current cost of operation and support'.","V":"No testable criterion provided: no target reduction percentage, no baseline cost value, no measurement period, no definition of 'operation and support'—thus impossible to verify; evidence: 'reduce the current cost of operation and support'."}, 
  "suggestions": {"U":"Specify the set of agencies using OMB Circular A-11 Appendix C classification (e.g., 'all 24 CFO Act agencies as defined in OMB Circular A-11, Section 40.2, as of FY2023') and define 'operation and support' as 'full-time equivalent labor hours plus cloud infrastructure spend tracked via AWS/Azure billing APIs'.","A":"Replace 'meet the needs' with 'support at least 95% of documented mission-critical workflows per agency’s certified workflow inventory (v2.1 or later)'.","C":"Keep unchanged—no correction needed for factual accuracy, though precision requires improvement under other dimensions.","V":"The service shall reduce total annual operation and support cost (defined as sum of labor FTE cost + cloud infrastructure cost, measured in USD) by ≥15% relative to the FY2023 baseline ($X.XXM), as verified by auditable cost reports generated monthly for 12 consecutive months starting FY2025 Q1."},
  "issues": [
    {"type":"U","evidence":"all executive branch agencies","rewrite":"all 24 CFO Act agencies as defined in OMB Circular A-11, Section 40.2, as of FY2023"},
    {"type":"A","evidence":"meet the needs","rewrite":"support at least 95% of documented mission-critical workflows per agency’s certified workflow inventory (v2.1 or later)"},
